      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Pre-Loading Inspection, Odometer Logging &amp; Photographic Audit for Bike Transportation Sultanpur Safe</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Transporting two-wheelers and motorcycles requires meticulous planning to ensure a smooth and hassle‑free experience. A comprehensive pre‑loading protocol is essential to guarantee the safe transit of your vehicle.</p>
<p>This involves conducting a thorough digital condition audit, checking battery terminals, regulating fuel levels, and managing FASTag details. Whether you opt for packers and movers in Sultanpur or prefer to book a train for bike transport through Indian Railways, understanding the necessary procedures can make a significant difference.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">360‑Degree Digital Condition Audit</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Capture high‑resolution images and videos of the bike from every angle, noting scratches, dents, or any existing damage. This visual record serves as proof for insurance claims and helps the transporter verify the vehicle’s condition before loading.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Battery Terminal Checks</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Clean terminals to remove corrosion, then disconnect the battery to avoid accidental starts or short circuits. Secure the battery with straps or a dedicated holder so it remains stable during movement.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">One‑Quarter Tank Fuel Regulation</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Keep the fuel level at roughly 25 % of tank capacity. This amount is sufficient to prevent fuel line issues while minimizing the risk of spillage or fire hazards during transit.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">FASTag Management</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Deactivate or update the FASTag to prevent unintended toll deductions. Provide the tag details to the logistics partner—whether it’s a packer‑mover service, RTC bike parcel, or railway operator—so they can handle tolls appropriately.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #ec489922; color: #ec4899; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">05</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Documentation for Train Transport</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">When using Indian Railways bike transport, prepare the vehicle registration certificate, insurance copy, a valid ID proof, and a signed consignment note. Knowing the exact bike transport by train documents required streamlines the booking process and avoids delays.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Following this checklist ensures a seamless two‑wheeler transport experience, whether you choose the best bike transport options from packers and movers, RTC bike parcel services, or the Indian Railways network.</p>
